<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">SEEA-R1: Tree-Structured Reinforcement Fine-Tuning for Self-Evolving Embodied Agents</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
